{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 18,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 504.82,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it came to pass that Alma, who had fled from the servants of king Noah,",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.428,
      "end": 8.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repented of his sins and iniquities,",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.255,
      "end": 10.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went about privately among the people,",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.082,
      "end": 13.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to teach the words of Abinadi\u2014",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.316,
      "end": 16.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, concerning that which was to come,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.05,
      "end": 19.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also concerning the resurrection of the dead,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.109,
      "end": 22.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the redemption of the people,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.379,
      "end": 27.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was to be brought to pass through the power, and sufferings, and death of Christ,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.178,
      "end": 31.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his resurrection and ascension into heaven.",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.691,
      "end": 34.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as many as would hear his word he did teach.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.657,
      "end": 36.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he taught them privately,",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 36.88,
      "end": 39.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it might not come to the knowledge of the king.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.032,
      "end": 42.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many did believe his words.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 42.988,
      "end": 46.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as many as did believe him",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.233,
      "end": 49.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did go forth to a place which was called Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 49.617,
      "end": 52.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having received its name from the king,",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 52.212,
      "end": 54.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being in the borders of the land",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 54.76,
      "end": 58.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having been infested, by times or at seasons, by wild beasts.",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.248,
      "end": 62.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, there was in Mormon a fountain of pure water,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.679,
      "end": 64.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Alma resorted thither,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.856,
      "end": 68.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there being near the water a thicket of small trees,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 68.519,
      "end": 73.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "where he did hide himself in the daytime from the searches of the king.",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.54,
      "end": 79.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as many as believed him went thither to hear his words.",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 80.375,
      "end": 82.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after many days",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 83.016,
      "end": 87.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there were a goodly number gathered together at the place of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 87.376,
      "end": 88.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to hear the words of Alma.",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 89.135,
      "end": 92.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, all were gathered together that believed on his word,",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 92.844,
      "end": 94.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to hear him.",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 94.185,
      "end": 97.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did teach them, and did preach unto them",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 97.755,
      "end": 101.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repentance, and redemption, and faith on the Lord.",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 101.779,
      "end": 104.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he said unto them:",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 104.42,
      "end": 106.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, here are the waters of Mormon",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 106.829,
      "end": 108.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for thus were they called)",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 109.006,
      "end": 112.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now, as ye are desirous to come into the fold of God,",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 112.576,
      "end": 114.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to be called his people,",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 114.428,
      "end": 117.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and are willing to bear one another's burdens,",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 117.673,
      "end": 119.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be light;",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 120.164,
      "end": 123.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and are willing to mourn with those that mourn;",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 123.455,
      "end": 127.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and comfort those that stand in need of comfort,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 127.257,
      "end": 131.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to stand as witnesses of God at all times and in all things,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 131.709,
      "end": 135.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in all places that ye may be in, even until death,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 135.697,
      "end": 137.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may be redeemed of God,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.013,
      "end": 141.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be numbered with those of the first resurrection",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 141.862,
      "end": 143.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may have eternal life\u2014",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.632,
      "end": 146.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I say unto you,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 146.345,
      "end": 148.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if this be the desire of your hearts,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 148.986,
      "end": 152.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what have you against being baptized in the name of the Lord,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 152.556,
      "end": 154.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a witness before him",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 154.454,
      "end": 157.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye have entered into a covenant with him,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 157.374,
      "end": 160.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye will serve him and keep his commandments,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 160.433,
      "end": 164.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may pour out his Spirit more abundantly upon you?",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 164.735,
      "end": 167.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when the people had heard these words,",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 167.423,
      "end": 170.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they clapped their hands for joy, and exclaimed:",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 170.529,
      "end": 172.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This is the desire of our hearts.",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 173.113,
      "end": 175.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that Alma took Helam,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 176.126,
      "end": 177.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being one of the first,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 178.071,
      "end": 180.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went and stood forth in the water,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 180.898,
      "end": 182.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried, saying:",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 182.843,
      "end": 183.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 184.045,
      "end": 186.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "pour out thy Spirit upon thy servant,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 186.686,
      "end": 189.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may do this work with holiness of heart.",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 190.199,
      "end": 192.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when he had said these words,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 192.469,
      "end": 195.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Spirit of the Lord was upon him, and he said:",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 195.76,
      "end": 196.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Helam,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 196.915,
      "end": 198.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I baptize thee,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 198.442,
      "end": 200.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having authority from the Almighty God,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 201.037,
      "end": 204.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a testimony that ye have entered into a covenant",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 205.025,
      "end": 208.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to serve him until you are dead as to the mortal body;",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 208.595,
      "end": 211.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and may the Spirit of the Lord be poured out upon you;",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 212.072,
      "end": 216.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and may he grant unto you eternal life, through the redemption of Christ,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 216.71,
      "end": 220.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom he has prepared from the foundation of the world.",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.687,
      "end": 223.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after Alma had said these words,",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 223.282,
      "end": 226.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both Alma and Helam were buried in the water;",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 226.295,
      "end": 230.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they arose and came forth out of the water rejoicing,",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 230.422,
      "end": 232.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being filled with the Spirit.",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 232.867,
      "end": 235.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, Alma took another,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 235.694,
      "end": 238.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth a second time into the water,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 238.521,
      "end": 241.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and baptized him according to the first,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 241.209,
      "end": 244.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only he did not bury himself again in the water.",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 245.047,
      "end": 248.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner he did baptize every one",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 248.292,
      "end": 250.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that went forth to the place of Mormon;",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 251.026,
      "end": 254.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were in number about two hundred and four souls;",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 254.735,
      "end": 258.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they were baptized in the waters of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 258.491,
      "end": 260.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were filled with the grace of God.",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 261.4,
      "end": 263.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were called the church of God,",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 263.902,
      "end": 266.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the church of Christ, from that time forward.",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 266.822,
      "end": 274.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that whosoever was baptized by the power and authority of God was added to his church.",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 274.747,
      "end": 279.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma, having authority from God, ordained priests;",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 279.664,
      "end": 283.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even one priest to every fifty of their number did he ordain",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 283.838,
      "end": 285.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to preach unto them,",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 285.69,
      "end": 289.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to teach them concerning the things pertaining to the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 290.317,
      "end": 293.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he commanded them that they should teach nothing",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 293.283,
      "end": 295.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were the things which he had taught,",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 296.11,
      "end": 299.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and which had been spoken by the mouth of the holy prophets.",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 300.505,
      "end": 303.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even he commanded them that they should preach nothing",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 304.075,
      "end": 306.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were repentance and faith on the Lord,",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 307.134,
      "end": 308.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had redeemed his people.",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 309.625,
      "end": 314.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he commanded them that there should be no contention one with another,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 314.867,
      "end": 318.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they should look forward with one eye,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 318.251,
      "end": 319.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having one faith",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 319.917,
      "end": 321.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and one baptism,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 321.769,
      "end": 326.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having their hearts knit together in unity and in love one towards another.",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 327.047,
      "end": 329.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he commanded them to preach.",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 329.595,
      "end": 332.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they became the children of God.",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 332.736,
      "end": 337.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he commanded them that they should observe the sabbath day, and keep it holy,",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 337.374,
      "end": 340.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also every day they should give thanks to the Lord their God.",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 341.351,
      "end": 348.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also commanded them that the priests whom he had ordained should labor with their own hands for their support.",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 349.322,
      "end": 352.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was one day in every week that was set apart",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 352.799,
      "end": 357.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should gather themselves together to teach the people,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 357.391,
      "end": 359.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to worship the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 359.475,
      "end": 362.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, as often as it was in their power,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 362.999,
      "end": 365.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to assemble themselves together.",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 365.908,
      "end": 370.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the priests were not to depend upon the people for their support;",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 370.36,
      "end": 373.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but for their labor they were to receive the grace of God,",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 373.884,
      "end": 376.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might wax strong in the Spirit,",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 376.99,
      "end": 378.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having the knowledge of God,",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 379.12,
      "end": 382.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might teach with power and authority from God.",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 383.608,
      "end": 389.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again Alma commanded that the people of the church should impart of their substance,",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 389.779,
      "end": 392.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every one according to that which he had;",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 392.374,
      "end": 395.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if he have more abundantly he should impart more abundantly;",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 396.13,
      "end": 398.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of him that had but little,",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 398.4,
      "end": 400.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but little should be required;",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 400.438,
      "end": 402.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to him that had not should be given.",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 403.115,
      "end": 405.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they should impart of their substance",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 405.896,
      "end": 409.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of their own free will and good desires towards God,",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 409.42,
      "end": 411.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to those priests that stood in need,",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 412.108,
      "end": 414.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and to every needy, naked soul.",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 415.249,
      "end": 417.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this he said unto them,",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 417.24,
      "end": 419.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having been commanded of God;",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 419.51,
      "end": 422.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did walk uprightly before God,",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 422.291,
      "end": 428.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "imparting to one another both temporally and spiritually according to their needs and their wants.",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 429.333,
      "end": 432.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that all this was done in Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 432.857,
      "end": 434.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by the waters of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 435.173,
      "end": 438.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the forest that was near the waters of Mormon;",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 438.325,
      "end": 440.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the place of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 440.27,
      "end": 441.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the waters of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 442.075,
      "end": 443.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the forest of Mormon,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 443.788,
      "end": 446.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how beautiful are they to the eyes of them",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 447.033,
      "end": 449.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who there came to the knowledge of their Redeemer;",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 450.092,
      "end": 452.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and how blessed are they,",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 452.362,
      "end": 454.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall sing to his praise forever.",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 455.364,
      "end": 458.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these things were done in the borders of the land,",
      "verse": "18:31",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 458.795,
      "end": 461.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not come to the knowledge of the king.",
      "verse": "18:31",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 462.354,
      "end": 468.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it came to pass that the king, having discovered a movement among the people,",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 468.571,
      "end": 470.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "sent his servants to watch them.",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 470.934,
      "end": 474.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore on the day that they were assembling themselves together",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 474.504,
      "end": 476.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to hear the word of the Lord",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 476.681,
      "end": 479.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were discovered unto the king.",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 479.962,
      "end": 484.513,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the king said that Alma was stirring up the people to rebellion against him;",
      "verse": "18:33",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 484.693,
      "end": 487.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he sent his army to destroy them.",
      "verse": "18:33",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 487.974,
      "end": 494.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma and the people of the Lord were apprised of the coming of the king's army;",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 494.795,
      "end": 500.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they took their tents and their families and departed into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 500.769,
      "end": 504.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were in number about four hundred and fifty souls.",
      "verse": "18:35",
      "lineIndex": 157
    }
  ]
}